WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.943 --> 00:00:04.510
Look for G Guide. Start with currencies, then savings, income, expenses and tasks.

2
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:08.190
Choose the recommended avatar tour. You can pause or return to Guide any time.

3
00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:12.802
Settings first: choose your report currency. Set manual rates for other currencies.

4
00:00:12.802 --> 00:00:17.368
Add existing savings once. It is money already saved, not new income.

5
00:00:17.368 --> 00:00:22.032
This is a preview only. Review currency and date; Cancel leaves your records unchanged.

6
00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:26.677
Record the full income. Its savings allocation is part of that amount, not extra money.

7
00:00:26.677 --> 00:00:31.318
Preview: 700 USD income, save 200; 500 remains for spending. Cancel leaves records unchanged.

8
00:00:31.318 --> 00:00:35.912
Expenses reduce spending money. Savings stay separate until you withdraw from them.

9
00:00:35.912 --> 00:00:40.556
This is a preview only. Review currency and date; Cancel leaves your records unchanged.

10
00:00:40.556 --> 00:00:45.137
Then add one small task. Pick its date, and optionally its time and reminder.

11
00:00:45.137 --> 00:00:49.797
This is a preview only. Review currency and date; Cancel leaves your records unchanged.

12
00:00:49.797 --> 00:00:54.367
Return to Today each day. All amounts in the guide are examples, not your balances.

13
00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:57.372
Use G Guide whenever you need help. No example records were saved in this walkthrough.
